#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:73
msgid "``--path <path>``"
msgstr "``--path <path>``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:74
msgid "Server root"
msgstr "Serverens rod"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:75
msgid "Synchronize a remote subfolder, for example ``/Documents``."
msgstr "Synkroniser en undermappe på serveren, f.eks. ``/Documents``."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:76
msgid "``--user <user>``, ``-u <user>``"
msgstr "``--user <user>``, ``-u <user>``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:77 ../../desktop/commandline.rst:80
msgid "See credentials below"
msgstr "Se loginoplysninger nedenfor"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:78
msgid "Login name. Overrides the username in the server URL."
msgstr "Loginnavn. Tilsidesætter brugernavnet i serverens URL."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:79
msgid "``--password <password>``, ``-p <password>``"
msgstr "``--password <password>``, ``-p <password>``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:81
msgid ""
"Password or app password. Overrides the password in the server URL. Command-"
"line passwords may be visible in process listings and shell history."
msgstr ""
"Adgangskode eller app-adgangskode. Tilsidesætter adgangskoden i serverens "
"URL. Adgangskoder på kommandolinjen kan være synlige i proceslister og "
"shellens historik."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:83
msgid "``-n``"
msgstr "``-n``"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:18
#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:84 ../../desktop/commandline.rst:88
#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:91 ../../desktop/commandline.rst:94
#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:105 ../../desktop/commandline.rst:108
#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:125
msgid "Not set"
msgstr "Ikke sat"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:85
msgid ""
"Read credentials from a matching host or default entry in ``.netrc``. These "
"replace credentials supplied in the URL or with ``--user`` and "
"``--password``."
msgstr ""
"Læs loginoplysninger fra en matchende vært eller standardpost i ``.netrc``. "
"De erstatter loginoplysninger, der er angivet i URL'en eller med ``--user`` "
"og ``--password``."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:87
msgid "``--non-interactive``"
msgstr "``--non-interactive``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:89
msgid ""
"Do not prompt for credentials. Read missing credentials from ``NC_USER`` and"
" ``NC_PASSWORD``."
msgstr ""
"Spørg ikke efter loginoplysninger. Læs manglende loginoplysninger fra "
"``NC_USER`` og ``NC_PASSWORD``."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:90
msgid "``--silent``, ``-s``"
msgstr "``--silent``, ``-s``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:92
msgid "Suppress Qt log messages. Does not suppress every console message."
msgstr ""
"Undertryk logbeskeder fra Qt. Undertrykker ikke alle beskeder i konsollen."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:93
msgid "``--trust``"
msgstr "``--trust``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:95
msgid ""
"Accept untrusted TLS certificates. Use only for a controlled diagnostic run;"
" normally fix the certificate trust configuration."
msgstr ""
"Accepter TLS-certifikater, der ikke er tillid til. Brug det kun til en "
"kontrolleret fejlfinding; ret normalt opsætningen af tillid til "
"certifikater."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:97
msgid "``--httpproxy <url>``"
msgstr "``--httpproxy <url>``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:98
msgid "No explicit proxy"
msgstr "Ingen udtrykkelig proxy"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:99
msgid ""
"Set an HTTP proxy using ``http://hostname:port``. This option does not parse"
" proxy credentials in the URL."
msgstr ""
"Angiv en HTTP-proxy med ``http://hostname:port``. Optionen fortolker ikke "
"loginoplysninger til proxyen i URL'en."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:100
msgid "``--exclude <file>``"
msgstr "``--exclude <file>``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:101
msgid "System exclude list"
msgstr "Systemets udelukkelsesliste"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:102
msgid ""
"Add an exclude list. The file must exist. Pattern anchoring depends on its "
"filename; see :ref:`desktop-command-line-excludes`."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj en udelukkelsesliste. Filen skal findes. Hvordan mønstrene forankres,"
" afhænger af filnavnet; se :ref:`desktop-command-line-excludes`."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:104
msgid "``--exclude-anchored <file>``"
msgstr "``--exclude-anchored <file>``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:106
msgid ""
"Add an exclude list with patterns anchored at the sync root, regardless of "
"the filename."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj en udelukkelsesliste med mønstre, der er forankret i "
"synkroniseringsroden, uanset filnavnet."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:107
msgid "``--unsyncedfolders <file>``"
msgstr "``--unsyncedfolders <file>``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:109
msgid ""
"Read remote folders to exclude from synchronization, one relative path per "
"line. Empty lines and lines starting with ``#`` are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Læs mapper på serveren, der skal udelukkes fra synkronisering, med én "
"relativ sti pr. linje. Tomme linjer og linjer, der starter med ``#``, "
"ignoreres."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:111
msgid "``--max-sync-retries <number>``"
msgstr "``--max-sync-retries <number>``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:112
msgid "``3``"
msgstr "``3``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:113
msgid ""
"Maximum number of follow-up runs when the sync engine requests another sync."
" This is not a general retry count for every failed request."
msgstr ""
"Maksimalt antal opfølgende kørsler, når synkroniseringsmotoren beder om "
"endnu en synkronisering. Det er ikke et generelt antal genforsøg for alle "
"mislykkede forespørgsler."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:115
msgid "``--uplimit <number>``"
msgstr "``--uplimit <number>``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:116 ../../desktop/commandline.rst:119
msgid "``0`` KB/s"
msgstr "``0`` KB/s"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:117
msgid ""
"Upload speed limit in KB/s (1000 bytes per second). Zero means unlimited."
msgstr ""
"Grænse for hastighed ved overførsel i KB/s (1000 byte pr. sekund). Nul "
"betyder ubegrænset."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:118
msgid "``--downlimit <number>``"
msgstr "``--downlimit <number>``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:120
msgid ""
"Download speed limit in KB/s (1000 bytes per second). Zero means unlimited."
msgstr ""
"Grænse for hastighed ved hentning i KB/s (1000 byte pr. sekund). Nul betyder"
" ubegrænset."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:121
msgid "``-h``"
msgstr "``-h``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:122
msgid "Hidden files included"
msgstr "Skjulte filer medtages"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:123
msgid ""
"Include hidden files. This is already the default; ``-h`` does not display "
"help."
msgstr ""
"Medtag skjulte filer. Det er allerede standard; ``-h`` viser ikke hjælpen."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:124
msgid "``--logdebug``"
msgstr "``--logdebug``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:126
msgid "Enable Nextcloud debug logging and send log output to standard output."
msgstr ""
"Slå Nextclouds fejlsøgningslogning til, og send loggen til standard output."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:127
msgid "``--confdir <directory>``"
msgstr "``--confdir <directory>``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:128
msgid "Standard location"
msgstr "Standardplacering"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:129
msgid ""
"Use a different configuration directory. Does not make the one-run sync "
"inherit all desktop sync settings."
msgstr ""
"Brug en anden konfigurationsmappe. Får ikke den enkeltstående synkronisering"
" til at arve alle skrivebordsappens synkroniseringsindstillinger."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:130
msgid "``--version``, ``-v``"
msgstr "``--version``, ``-v``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:131
msgid "Not requested"
msgstr "Ikke anmodet"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:132
msgid ""
"Display version information and exit. Run this option without the directory "
"and server arguments."
msgstr ""
"Vis versionsoplysninger, og afslut. Kør optionen uden argumenterne for mappe"
" og server."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:138
msgid "Credential handling"
msgstr "Håndtering af loginoplysninger"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:140
msgid "Credentials are read in this order:"
msgstr "Loginoplysninger læses i denne rækkefølge:"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:142
msgid "Username and password in the server URL, if supplied."
msgstr "Brugernavn og adgangskode i serverens URL, hvis de er angivet."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:143
msgid ""
"``--user`` and ``--password``, which replace the corresponding URL values."
msgstr ""
"``--user`` og ``--password``, som erstatter de tilsvarende værdier i URL'en."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:144
msgid ""
"A matching host or default ``.netrc`` entry when ``-n`` is used, which "
"replaces both values."
msgstr ""
"En matchende vært eller standardpost i ``.netrc``, når ``-n`` bruges, som "
"erstatter begge værdier."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:145
msgid ""
"Prompts for any missing values, or the environment variables below when "
"``--non-interactive`` is used."
msgstr ""
"Spørger efter manglende værdier, eller bruger miljøvariablerne nedenfor, når"
" ``--non-interactive`` bruges."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:147
msgid ""
"Prefer a password prompt or a protected ``.netrc`` file over putting "
"passwords in a command or URL."
msgstr ""
"Brug hellere en forespørgsel om adgangskoden eller en beskyttet "
"``.netrc``-fil end at skrive adgangskoder i en kommando eller URL."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:157
msgid "``NC_USER``"
msgstr "``NC_USER``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:158 ../../desktop/commandline.rst:162
msgid "Unset"
msgstr "Ikke sat"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:159
msgid ""
"Username fallback for a one-run sync with ``--non-interactive``. Only used "
"if no username was supplied by the preceding methods."
msgstr ""
"Reserve for brugernavnet ved en enkeltstående synkronisering med ``--non-"
"interactive``. Bruges kun, hvis der ikke er angivet et brugernavn med de "
"foregående metoder."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:161
msgid "``NC_PASSWORD``"
msgstr "``NC_PASSWORD``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:163
msgid ""
"Password fallback for a one-run sync with ``--non-interactive``. Only used "
"if no password was supplied by the preceding methods."
msgstr ""
"Reserve for adgangskoden ved en enkeltstående synkronisering med ``--non-"
"interactive``. Bruges kun, hvis der ikke er angivet en adgangskode med de "
"foregående metoder."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:166
msgid ""
"These variables do not supply credentials for the account setup mode below. "
"For transfer overrides shared with the desktop sync engine, see "
":ref:`desktop-environment-variables`. ``nextcloudcmd`` uses an initial chunk"
" size of 100 MiB, a minimum of 5 MB, a maximum of 5 GB, and 6 parallel jobs "
"unless overridden by those variables. It does not read the desktop app's "
"chunk-size settings from ``nextcloud.cfg``."
msgstr ""
"Variablerne giver ikke loginoplysninger til tilstanden til kontoopsætning "
"nedenfor. Se :ref:`desktop-environment-variables` for tilsidesættelser af "
"overførsler, der deles med skrivebordsklientens synkroniseringsmotor. "
"``nextcloudcmd`` bruger en første chunk-størrelse på 100 MiB, et minimum på "
"5 MB, et maksimum på 5 GB og 6 parallelle job, medmindre variablerne "
"tilsidesætter det. Den læser ikke skrivebordsappens indstillinger for chunk-"
"størrelse fra ``nextcloud.cfg``."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:175
msgid "Exclude lists"
msgstr "Udelukkelseslister"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:177
msgid ""
"The client loads the system exclude list when available. You can add your "
"own list with ``--exclude`` or ``--exclude-anchored``. A missing explicitly "
"supplied file is an error."
msgstr ""
"Klienten indlæser systemets udelukkelsesliste, når den findes. Du kan "
"tilføje din egen liste med ``--exclude`` eller ``--exclude-anchored``. Det "
"er en fejl, hvis en udtrykkeligt angivet fil mangler."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:180
msgid ""
"With ``--exclude``, a file named ``sync-exclude.lst`` uses the sync root for"
" pattern matching. Other filenames can use the exclude file's directory as "
"the base. Use ``--exclude-anchored`` when the filename and location should "
"not affect matching."
msgstr ""
"Med ``--exclude`` bruger en fil, der hedder ``sync-exclude.lst``, "
"synkroniseringsroden til matchning af mønstre. Andre filnavne kan bruge "
"udelukkelsesfilens mappe som udgangspunkt. Brug ``--exclude-anchored``, når "
"filnavnet og placeringen ikke skal påvirke matchningen."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:184
msgid "Write one pattern per line. Wildcards are supported, for example:"
msgstr "Skriv ét mønster pr. linje. Jokertegn understøttes, f.eks.:"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:193
msgid "Account setup"
msgstr "Kontoopsætning"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:195
msgid ""
"``nextcloudcmd`` can also save an account for use by the desktop app. The "
"presence of ``--userid`` selects this mode; omit the positional local "
"directory and server URL used for a one-run sync. The command exits after "
"setup completes."
msgstr ""
"``nextcloudcmd`` kan også gemme en konto, som skrivebordsappen kan bruge. "
"Det er ``--userid``, der vælger denne tilstand; udelad den lokale mappe og "
"serverens URL, som bruges til en enkeltstående synkronisering. Kommandoen "
"afslutter, når opsætningen er færdig."

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:11
msgid "``--userid <user>``"
msgstr "``--userid <user>``"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:12
#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:15
msgid "Required"
msgstr "Påkrævet"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:13
msgid "User ID for the account to create."
msgstr "Bruger-ID for den konto, der skal oprettes."

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:14
msgid "``--serverurl <url>``"
msgstr "``--serverurl <url>``"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:16
msgid ""
"Base URL of the Nextcloud server, for example ``https://cloud.example.com``."
msgstr "Nextcloud-serverens basis-URL, f.eks. ``https://cloud.example.com``."

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:17
msgid "``--apppassword <password>``"
msgstr "``--apppassword <password>``"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:19
msgid ""
"App password for the account. If omitted, the account is saved and you must "
"log in from the desktop app later."
msgstr ""
"App-adgangskode til kontoen. Hvis den udelades, gemmes kontoen, og du skal "
"logge ind fra skrivebordsappen senere."

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:20
msgid "``--localdirpath <path>``"
msgstr "``--localdirpath <path>``"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:21
msgid "Suggested folder"
msgstr "Foreslået mappe"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:22
msgid ""
"Local sync folder. If omitted, use the folder suggested by the setup wizard."
" An existing folder must be empty. Ignored when macOS File Provider mode is "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"Lokal synkroniseringsmappe. Hvis den udelades, bruges den mappe, "
"opsætningsguiden foreslår. En eksisterende mappe skal være tom. Ignoreres, "
"når File Provider-tilstand på macOS er slået til."

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:24
msgid "``--remotedirpath <path>``"
msgstr "``--remotedirpath <path>``"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:25
msgid "``/``"
msgstr "``/``"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:26
msgid ""
"Remote folder for the new classic sync connection. Applies when a local sync"
" folder is created."
msgstr ""
"Mappe på serveren til den nye klassiske synkroniseringsforbindelse. Gælder, "
"når der oprettes en lokal synkroniseringsmappe."

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:27
msgid "``--isvfsenabled <0|1>``"
msgstr "``--isvfsenabled <0|1>``"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:28
msgid "``0``"
msgstr "``0``"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:29
msgid ""
"Use ``1`` to request virtual files for the new classic sync folder, where "
"supported, or ``0`` to download files. This does not enable macOS File "
"Provider mode."
msgstr ""
"Brug ``1`` for at bede om virtuelle filer for den nye klassiske "
"synkroniseringsmappe, hvor det understøttes, eller ``0`` for at hente "
"filerne. Det slår ikke File Provider-tilstanden på macOS til."

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:200
msgid ""
"For example, save an account and log in from the desktop app afterward:"
msgstr "Gem f.eks. en konto, og log ind fra skrivebordsappen bagefter:"
